- --Upstairs, here!

1581
01:06:06,497 --> 01:06:08,265
On the roof.

1582
01:06:08,298 --> 01:06:09,500
You know, he's right again!

1583
01:06:09,533 --> 01:06:11,035
Operation whirlybird

1584
01:06:11,068 --> 01:06:14,105
commences now!

1585
01:06:14,138 --> 01:06:15,840
Holiday inn,
towering a full

