Good. Commander.

1703
01:10:49,012 --> 01:10:50,580
Oh, time to go.

1704
01:10:50,613 --> 01:10:52,348
- Oh.
- Everything's ideal

1705
01:10:52,382 --> 01:10:53,650
- let's do it.
- Let's fall in love.

1706
01:10:53,683 --> 01:10:56,153
Set the trap tonight.

1707
01:10:56,187 --> 01:10:59,357
I agree. Contact
all operational points.

